Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 10:06:38 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): resolve tenant subdomains on production custom
 domains, not just localhost

apps/web/middleware.ts only matched *.localhost hostnames, so the
Vercel free-tier deployment path documented in
docs/deployment/FREE_TIER_CLOUD.md (Step 7: wildcard DNS *.yourdomain.com
-> Vercel) silently did not work once deployed - the root-path ->
/dashboard redirect and the tenant query-param rewrite never fired for
a real production subdomain.

- Extract subdomain resolution into extractSubdomain(), mirroring the
  logic already used server-side in
  apps/api/src/middleware/tenantRouting.ts (localhost handling +
  3+ label production domains).
- Explicitly exclude *.vercel.app / *.netlify.app so preview deploy
  URLs are never misrouted as a tenant subdomain.
- Add apps/web/lib/vitest-auto/41-middleware-tenant.auto.test.ts
  following the repo's existing vitest-auto convention (see
  32-tenant-host.auto.test.ts) - this path previously had no test
  coverage at all.
- Update docs/deployment/FREE_TIER_CLOUD.md Step 7 to reflect that
  middleware.ts now actually handles this instead of telling the
  reader to go configure it themselves.
